# Google Sheets AI Lesson Assistant

**Live API**: https://gsheets-gemini.onrender.com/docs
**Live Sheet Demo**: [View Sheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/...)

## How to use
1. Open Sheet
2. Change `topic=...` in URL
3. Get lesson plan + 5 MCQ in cells

## Tech
- FastAPI
- Gemini 1.5 Flash
- Render.com